You do it, you do it.

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:31.294
So Sweet Tooth in the games,

00:03:31.294 --> 00:03:32.587
he's always been like a maniac

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:35.089
and he's never had a ton of backstory

00:03:35.089 --> 00:03:36.966
