to like really build up

00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:39.052
Sweet Tooth as like a fully
dimensional character

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.638
and shooting those scenes was
like an absolute blast.

00:03:41.638 --> 00:03:42.847
Here for the show?

00:03:42.847 --> 00:03:44.807
I'm definitely here for the show!

00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:48.436
What was it like for you
Anthony working with Joe?

00:03:48.436 --> 00:03:49.604
Because you guys had
fight scenes together.

00:03:49.604 --> 00:03:51.397
Well yeah, I mean it hurt but...

00:03:53.816 --> 00:03:55.693
I'm like, "Dude, you realize I'm not

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:58.446
250 pounds or your size, right?"

00:03:58.446 --> 00:04:00.073
