00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.036
how was that for you guys?

00:04:05.203 --> 00:04:07.580
He's phenomenal I think in this.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.332
He's absolutely terrifying.

00:04:09.332 --> 00:04:11.209
And then I spit in his face that one time.

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:12.543
-Oh my god
-Remember when I accidentally...

00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:15.505
Whoa! Why'd you do that?

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:17.131
And he was very gracious about it.

00:04:17.131 --> 00:04:18.466
He was so nice.

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:22.428
That was... that was a
real moment for me.

00:04:23.471 --> 00:04:25.890
We'll revisit that attitude in a few hours.

00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:27.183
Can't wait.

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:30.228
I think the great thing about this
show is it's an escape.

00:04:30.228 --> 00:04:32.146
It's cars, it’s explosions,

00:04:32.146 --> 00:04:33.022
